From: richie-rich90454 <rjian880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0004/0014] Remove all telemetry

Pins enableTelemetry to false in product.json so no telemetry can be enabled from
settings or configuration, alongside the channel removals listed in
docs/ide/telemetry-audit.md.

Rebased onto upstream 1.137.0; the change is a single product.json key, so it
applies unchanged.

Verification: ide/tests/no-network-test/run.sh + ide/tests/patch-smoke.sh (0004-*)

---
diff --git a/product.json b/product.json
index ce1b16e6..7f61fb69 100644
--- a/product.json
+++ b/product.json
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
 	"licenseName": "MIT",
 	"licenseUrl": "https://github.com/example/jahaziel/blob/main/LICENSE",
 	"quality": "stable",
+	"enableTelemetry": false,
 	"serverLicenseUrl": "https://github.com/example/jahaziel/blob/main/LICENSE",
 	"serverGreeting": [],
 	"serverLicense": [],
